+/* Where a vertex array's physical address lives, with an override.
+ *
+ * A title's array offset is physical, and this runtime keeps ordinary RAM and
+ * the contiguous window as separate storage, so the number alone does not say
+ * which one holds the data; dma_resolve guesses from what the allocator has
